<title>INDIA: India's Lakshmi falls 8.0 pct on results.</title>
<headline>India's Lakshmi falls 8.0 pct on results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Indian textiles machinery maker Lakshmi Machine Works fell 513.25 rupees, or 7.9 percent, to 6,000 on the Bombay bourse on Thursday after the firm announced a fall in net profit, traders said.</p>
<p>Lakshmi Machine said after market hourse on Wednesday its 1996/97 net fell to 237.8 million rupees, from 429.6 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>Traders said the announcement of a bonus equity share -- in the ratio of one share for every one held -- failed to cheer sentiment in the stock.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
